# Normalize EOL for all files that Git considers text files.
# Root-level coverage: Bunnymark, godot-demo-2d-dodge-the-creeps,
# godot-demo-3d-squash-the-creeps, and repo-root files have no per-project
# .gitattributes, so a Windows checkout with core.autocrlf=true rewrites
# .tres/.tscn/.import text files to CRLF there (observed as churn + Godot
# resource parse failures in the 2026-07-13 Windows validation pass).
* text=auto eol=lf
